--- COMPUTATION (microseconds, mean +/- sample SD) ---

 Shared (public params pp=(A,H); KeyGen -> pk=t, sk=r):
   Setup             22.07 +/-   0.25
   KeyGen            30.09 +/-   0.20

 Base path (simplified Dilithium-style, c = H(pk, w, M); no t'):
   Sign             302.13 +/-  15.52
   Verify            70.99 +/-   0.07

 LAS adaptor path (statement t' folded into the hash, c = H(pk, w+t', M)):
   PreSign          306.14 +/-   7.89
   PreVerify         73.07 +/-   0.06
   Adapt             75.11 +/-   0.09
   Ext               25.13 +/-   0.03

 Adaptor overhead (adaptor op vs the base op it mirrors):
   PreSign       vs Sign       306.14 vs   302.13   (+1.3%)
   PreVerify     vs Verify      73.07 vs    70.99   (+2.9%)
   Adapt         vs Verify      75.11 vs    70.99   (+5.8%)
   Ext (separate)               25.13            (no base analogue)

